1542
01:57:28,125 --> 01:57:32,002
To divert her attention , I had to put the blame on Radha .

1543
01:57:33,213 --> 01:57:36,590
Now except for the three of us , even Radha knows everything .

1544
01:57:37,801 --> 01:57:40,886
When I told Radha about Avni 's ailment ...

1545
01:57:40,887 --> 01:57:43,889
... that innocent girl said , to save Avni she is prepared ...

1546
01:57:43,890 --> 01:57:47,893
... to pose as a mad girl all her life .

1547
01:57:48,228 --> 01:57:50,563
Siddharth ! Siddharth , open the door .

1548
01:57:52,023 --> 01:57:54,442
Siddharth , open the door .

1549
01:57:55,861 --> 01:57:57,528
