1569
01:59:32,499 --> 01:59:36,126
Whatever she did that day , it was all a part of it .

1570
01:59:37,128 --> 01:59:40,005
The onlooker will feel that you forced Avni ...

1571
01:59:40,006 --> 01:59:43,008
