1576
02:00:01,319 --> 02:00:05,573
Manjulika had taken an oath that she will never let any king live .

1577
02:00:06,992 --> 02:00:09,535
And in Avni 's view , Siddharth is the king here .

1578
02:00:09,953 --> 02:00:12,037
That 's way she can kill Siddharth any time .

1579
02:00:12,956 --> 02:00:17,501
If she fails in that , then she might commit suicide like Manjulika .

1580
02:00:19,087 --> 02:00:23,090
If I save Avni , then I will have to risk Siddharth 's life .

1581
02:00:23,592 --> 02:00:27,136
If you have to save Siddharth , then Avni will lose her life .

1582
02:00:27,512 --> 02:00:31,181
No matter what I do , someone is certain to die .

1583
02:00:54,539 --> 02:00:56,248
Greetings high priest . - Greetings .

1584
02:00:59,336 --> 02:01:01,795
I wanted to ask you something .

1585
02:01:03,548 --> 02:01:05,633
I have been very restless since two days .

1586
