For my friend , I have to use a way ...

1646
02:04:53,319 --> 02:04:56,947
... which no psychologist in the world might have used .

1647
02:04:57,615 --> 02:04:59,324
You know I have to go beyond the ...

1648
02:04:59,325 --> 02:05:01,618
